{
  "name": "encoding-guard",
  "displayName": "编码自动切换器 (GBK/GB18030/UTF-8)",
  "description": "自动检测文件编码并以正确编码打开，防止中文乱码；支持 UTF-8 与 GBK/GB18030 一键互相切换",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "encoding",
    "GB18030",
    "GBK",
    "UTF-8",
    "乱码",
    "编码",
    "encoding converter"
  ],
  "publisher": "GuGuDong",
  "author": "咕咕咚",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/qiuhai182/encoding-switcher.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "email": "2810617217@qq.com",
    "url": "https://github.com/qiuhai182/encoding-switcher/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/qiuhai182/encoding-switcher#readme",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.75.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other",
    "Programming Languages"
  ],
  "galleryBanner": {
    "color": "#1E3A8A",
    "theme": "dark"
  },
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "encoding-guard.saveWithEncoding",
        "title": "选择编码保存",
        "category": "编码切换",
        "icon": "$(file-code)"
      },
      {
        "command": "encoding-guard.openEncodingView",
        "title": "以正确编码查看",
        "category": "编码切换"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "编码切换器",
      "properties": {
        "encoding-guard.applyKernelGuess": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "markdownDescription": "把 `kernelGuessEncodings` 写入**当前工作区**的 `files.candidateGuessEncodings`（限制内核猜码范围）。**默认关闭**：部分内核/版本对候选列表支持不佳，强制写入会导致猜测失效、只回落默认编码"
        },
        "encoding-guard.detectionEncodings": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "default": [
            "gbk",
            "gb18030"
          ],
          "markdownDescription": "UTF-8 之外要自动识别/纠正/转换的编码列表（按优先级排序，使用 iconv-lite 支持的编码名，如 `gbk`、`gb18030`、`big5`、`shift_jis`、`cp1252` 等）。命令面板「选择编码保存」与「以正确编码查看」的选项也来自此列表"
        },
        "encoding-guard.kernelGuessEncodings": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "default": [
            "utf8",
            "gbk",
            "gb18030"
          ],
          "markdownDescription": "开启 `applyKernelGuess` 后写入内核 `files.candidateGuessEncodings` 的候选编码。注意：候选中不要包含某编码的子集（如 gbk 之外再放 gb2312），子集编解码会损坏扩展字符"
        }
      }
    },
    "menus": {
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "encoding-guard.saveWithEncoding",
          "group": "navigation",
          "when": "encoding-guard:isActive"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run build",
    "build": "node esbuild.js",
    "watch": "node esbuild.js --watch",
    "package": "vsce package"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^18.0.0",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.75.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.19.0",
    "ovsx": "^1.1.1",
    "typescript": "^5.3.0",
    "vsce": "^2.15.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "iconv-lite": "^0.7.3"
  }
}
